{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 42, :comments ["<b>And he shall plaster.</b> The opposite of יקציע, and it is from the root טחים; that which plasters." "And the word <b>and they shall take and bring.</b> Plural, in haste." "<b>And other dust he shall take.</b> The homeowner who wishes to dwell in it."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:10:09.967068646Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}